contentMarkdown:
These Geometrical Earings are ideal to match colorful outfits or to bring colours in a more single-colored-dress for instance.

The colours can be picked among a list of several leathers like Ortensia and Napoli (these colors), but also Dark Red, Navy, Violet, Olive, Cognac, dark brown, Natural (beige), or black if it's your colour 😉

2 fermoirs are available : hook (this one) or buckle (a closing one)

## “Pelle” Certificate

{{image:1}}
This version of leather product comes with a first grade leather, a tannery from Toscany (Italy) that respects the [Consortium Manifesto](notion:4a58a7b015244c8ea0d583c45532c0d3). It’s proof of quality, and respect for nature.

